00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.400
All right, so if you had
to choose, in real life,

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.570
AC Slater or Zach Morris.

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:57.510
This is no lie.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.810
